# Devendra-B

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Devendra</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: white;
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle at top, #18245a, #050510 70%
  );
}

.card {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 15px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.badge {
  color: #ffd700;
  border: 1px solid #ffd700;
  padding: 9px 20px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

h1 {
  margin-top: 25px;
  font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 55px);
  color: #fff;
  text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff39c6,
               0 0 35px #9d4dff;
  animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
}

.name {
  margin: 15px 0;
  font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 70px);
  font-weight: 900;
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg, #00eaff, #ff39c6, #ffd700
  );
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  color: transparent;
  animation: glow 1.5s infinite alternate;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.subtitle {
  color: #ffd700;
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.message {
  line-height: 2;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: #eeeeff;
  max-width: 420px;
}

.cake {
  font-size: 85px;
  margin: 20px 0;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px #ff39c6);
  animation: bounce 2s infinite;
}

button {
  border: none;
  margin-top: 25px;
  padding: 15px 28px;
  border-radius: 35px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff39c6, #7c4dff);
  color: white;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px #b13cff;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:active {
  transform: scale(0.95);
}

.footer {
  margin-top: 30px;
  color: #ffd700;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.balloon {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -120px;
  font-size: 45px;
  animation: float 9s linear infinite;
  opacity: 0.8;
}

.b1 { left: 5%; animation-delay: 0s; }
.b2 { left: 22%; animation-delay: 3s; }
.b3 { right: 15%; animation-delay: 1s; }
.b4 { right: 4%; animation-delay: 5s; }

@keyframes float {
  from { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); }
  to { transform: translateY(-120vh) rotate(25deg); }
}

@keyframes glow {
  from { filter: brightness(0.85); }
  to { filter: brightness(1.4); }
}

@keyframes bounce {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
}

.confetti {
  position: absolute;
  top: -20px;
  font-size: 22px;
  animation: fall 6s linear infinite;
}

.c1 { left: 15%; animation-delay: 1s; }
.c2 { left: 75%; animation-delay: 2s; }
.c3 { left: 45%; animation-delay: 4s; }
.c4 { left: 90%; animation-delay: 0s; }

@keyframes fall {
  to {
    transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(600deg);
  }
}

</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card">

  <div class="balloon b1">🎈</div>
  <div class="balloon b2">🎈</div>
  <div class="balloon b3">🎈</div>
  <div class="balloon b4">🎈</div>

  <div class="confetti c1">✨</div>
  <div class="confetti c2">🎊</div>
  <div class="confetti c3">⭐</div>
  <div class="confetti c4">🎉</div>

  <div class="badge">★ BIRTHDAY LEGEND ★</div>

  <h1>HAPPY BIRTHDAY</h1>

  <div class="name">DEVENDRA</div>

  <div class="subtitle">👑 The One & Only Legend 👑</div>

  <div class="cake">🎂</div>

  <div class="message">
    🎉 Happy Birthday Mere Bhai! 🎉<br>
    Tu dost nahi, bhai hai! ❤️<br>
    Teri life success se full rahe! 🚀<br>
    Tere saare dreams poore hon! 💪<br>
    Hamesha hasta aur chamakta reh! 😎
  </div>

  <button onclick="alert('🎉 Happy Birthday Devendra! ❤️ Best wishes from Sourabh! 🎂')">
    🎁 CLICK FOR SURPRISE
  </button>

  <div class="footer">
    Made with ❤️ by Sourabh<br><br>
    🔥 FRIENDSHIP LEVEL: INFINITE 🔥
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
                              
